Dialogue: 1,1:48:08.67,1:48:10.71,IN_CH_M2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\fax-0.15\blur4}牢记炫目的每一天
Dialogue: 1,1:48:10.71,1:48:13.47,IN_CH_M2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fax-0.15\blur4}玩得再疯一点
Dialogue: 1,1:48:13.47,1:48:16.55,IN_CH_M2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fax-0.15\blur4}一起分享梦境
Dialogue: 1,1:48:16.55,1:48:22.56,IN_CH_M2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fax-0.15\blur4}在最喜欢的事物包围下直到永远
