Dialogue: 1,1:48:36.11,1:48:39.08,IN_CH_M2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fax-0.15\blur4}再一起呼喊安可
Dialogue: 1,1:48:39.08,1:48:40.49,IN_CH_M2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fax-0.15\blur4}一起撒娇
Dialogue: 1,1:48:40.49,1:48:42.45,IN_CH_M2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fax-0.15\blur4}拼尽全力
Dialogue: 1,1:48:42.45,1:48:46.92,IN_CH_M2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fax-0.15\blur4}闪耀地放声高歌
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In「Reply」Part 2
